{"id":2802,"title":{"romaji":"Sword Art Online: Alicization","english":null,"native":null},"slug":"sword_art_online_alicization","synopsis":"The third season of *Sword Art Online*.\n\nKirito awakens in a vast, fantastical forest filled with towering trees. In his search for clues to the truth of his surroundings, he encounters a young boy who seems to know him. He ought to be a simple NPC, but the depth of his emotions seem no different than a human. As they search for the boy's parents, Kirito finds a peculiar memory returning to him. A memory from his own childhood, of this boy and a girl, too, with golden hair, and a name he should have never forgotten - Alice.\n\n(Source: Yen Press)\n\n\n*Note: The first episode aired with a runtime of ~48 minutes as opposed to the standard 24 minute long episode.*","format":"TV","season":"FALL","year":2018,"createdAt":"2021-03-27 00:44:39","updatedAt":"2021-03-28 08:23:49","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":36474},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":100182},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":13893},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":13493},{"site":"ANN","externalId":20665},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":9199},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null},{"site":"HIDIVE","externalId":null},{"site":"HULU","externalId":null},{"site":"NETFLIX","externalId":70302573}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":5591,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/LKl0BaiQk0KuKq6TGZzFLoq5sOUFlCk8TYP48KKG.jpg"},{"id":5592,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/fPKfMekWoI2uFnz4u1I31gFV2eCpqvD2CO5wAOKs.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":8,"name":"A-1 Pictures","slug":"a_1_pictures"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":157,"name":"Sword Art Online","slug":"sword_art_online"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":8082,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":1,"song":{"id":8083,"title":{"romaji":"ADAMAS","native":null}},"animethemeentries":[{"id":9456,"version":1,"episodes":"1-13","nsfw":false,"spoiler":f